// Copy this file to Local.xcconfig (same directory) and replace the value
// with your Apple ID team id: Xcode > Settings > Accounts > your account, or
// the target's Signing & Capabilities > Team (it looks like AB12CD34EF).
//
// Local.xcconfig is git-ignored on purpose — a team id is personal data and
// this repository is public, so it must never be committed.
DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = YOUR_TEAM_ID
